% ISO/IEC 24723 11.5: a 1X quiet zone beside the 2D component, which a CC-B places at the left edge
{ (\(01\)03512345678907|\(21\)abcdefghijklmnopqrstuv) (dontdraw dontlint ccversion=b) databarlimitedcomposite /borderleft get } 1 isEqual

% ISO/IEC 24723 Table 1: CC-C only with a GS1-128 linear component
{ (\(01\)03512345678907|\(21\)ABC) (dontdraw ccversion=c) databarlimitedcomposite } /bwipp.gs1ccCCCnotGS1128 isError

% The text of the linear component is centred on it, offsetting the centring across the whole symbol
{ (\(01\)03512345678907|\(21\)abcdefghijklmnopqrstuv) (dontdraw dontlint includetext ccversion=b) databarlimitedcomposite /opt get (text1xoffset) get } 4.5 isEqual  % (88 - 79) / 2

% The linear component is at least the height of the linear symbol: 6.60 mm / 0.660 mm = 10 modules
{ (\(01\)03512345678907|\(21\)A) (dontdraw loosespec ast=gs1.sst2) databarlimitedcomposite /rowheights get dup length 1 sub get } 10 isEqual
